graph TD
    accTitle: Continuous Delta Sync and FileLock Reconciliation Loop
    accDescr: Flowchart showing run_forever acquiring a FileLock, performing delta record sync and hard-delete reconciliation, releasing the lock, and waiting until stopped
    A[run_forever] --> B{stop_event set?}
    B -- No --> C[acquire FileLock]
    C --> D[load_records / delta sync]
    D --> E[reconcile hard-deletes]
    E --> F[release FileLock]
    F --> G[wait interval_seconds]
    G --> B
    B -- Yes --> H[log stopped]
